<title>USA: Pru Real Estate swaps apt for Equity shares.</title>
<headline>Pru Real Estate swaps apt for Equity shares.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Real Estate Investor said on Tuesday that it bought 692,023 shares of Equity Residential Properties Trust stock as part of the sale of a 256-unit California apartment complex to Equity Residential.</p>
<p>Prudential said the stock was purchased at a price of $45.88 per share. It added that the stock was purchased on behalf of the PRISA II commingled real estate investment fund.</p>
<p>Equity Residential shares fell 1/8 to 47-3/8 in late trading on Tuesday.</p>
